    <h1>A monthly, national feed of who controls development land. Here is what to do with it.</h1>
    <p class="lede">From April 2028 HM Land Registry publishes the contractual control dataset free, in a structured searchable form, at least monthly. Ownership was always visible. Control was not. That is the gap this data closes, and the gap existing land platforms have never been able to fill.</p>
